<title>UK: UK M4 grows final 9.5 pct in year to August.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows final 9.5 pct in year to August.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK monetary aggregates for August -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY				  August    pvs reported</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (adjusted)	    +1.0	 +0.9</p>
<p>	 in year to date (adjusted)	    +9.5	 +9.4</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (unadjusted)	  +0.9	 +0.7</p>
<p>	 in year to date (unadjusted)	  +9.5	 +9.3</p>
<p>Adjusted lending by banks, building</p>
<p>    societies in billions of stg		5.4	  4.8</p>
</text>
